Create a function called calculate_area with width, height:
    Return width * height

Set area to calculate_area(8, 5)
Print "Area of 8x5 rectangle:", area

Create a function called factorial with n:
    If n is at most 1:
        Return 1
    Return n * factorial(n - 1)

Print "Factorial of 5:", factorial(5)
Print "Factorial of 6:", factorial(6)

Create a function called make_multiplier with factor:
    Create a function called multiply with value:
        Return value * factor
    Return multiply

Set double to make_multiplier(2)
Set triple to make_multiplier(3)

Print "Double 15:", double(15)
Print "Triple 15:", triple(15)

Create a function called create_bank_account with initial_balance:
    Set balance to initial_balance

    Create a function called deposit with amount:
        Increase balance by amount
        Return balance

    Return deposit

Set my_account to create_bank_account(100)
Print "Balance after depositing 50:", my_account(50)
Print "Balance after depositing 25:", my_account(25)
